MEOW(Mid-term Equities Offline Workshop)

Requirements:
2. Python >= 3.8

To run the example code:
    -- cd <project directory>
    -- python3 meow.py

Optional C module:
    -- see AGENT_TRADING.md for prediction export and lightweight Trading Agent backtest usage.
    -- see C_AGENT_REPORT.md for C's report-ready Agent section.
    -- see C_PRESENTATION_NOTES.md for C's short presentation script and Q&A.
    -- B's GBT-final/meow.py supports MEOW_DATA_DIR, MEOW_BEST_PARAMS, MEOW_FEATURE_SET, and MEOW_PREDICTION_OUTPUT for C backtests.
    -- run_c_experiment.py generates C policy comparison, period-level checks, forecast decile summaries, and PPT-ready SVG charts from an exported prediction CSV.
    -- agent_factor_mining.py runs automatic factor mining from h5 data and exports factor-aware Agent diagnostics.
    -- agent_execution_sim.py adds simplified matching, slippage, queue, position, and equity-curve simulation.
    -- agent_rl_policy.py adds a lightweight Q-learning/contextual-bandit adaptive policy prototype.
    -- agent_controller.py summarizes all C-side Agent outputs into a final dashboard and decision examples.
